			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2072094">
									

<p>Wouldn't this be classed as keter rather than safe, because of the consqences of him aging having to be contained? If this thing can destroy history and there is no way to stop it except by keeping his memory intact then I think it deserves keter. and I am not entirely sure if his abilities are quite useful enough to classify as thaumiel. It is a really interesting idea and it is decently well written, but I think you need to expand more on some parts of it and fix some inconsistencies like it being classed as safe or thaumiel when it should be keter because of the disastrous effect he is having on history.</p>
